# Simple cube for testing the raytracer
# Vertices of a unit cube centered at origin
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5

# 12 triangles (2 per face)
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
f 2 6 7
f 2 7 3
f 6 5 8
f 6 8 7
f 5 1 4
f 5 4 8
f 4 3 7
f 4 7 8
f 5 6 2
f 5 2 1
